	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">DT_1IN0001</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○Table Name</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">Summary of Census Population(By administrative district/sex/age)</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○Term</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">null</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○Source</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">KOSIS(Source: Ministry of Data and Statistics, Population Census), 2026.10.02 09:59 </Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○Table URL</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">https://kosis.kr/statHtml/statHtml.do?orgId=101&tblId=DT_1IN0001&language=en&conn_path=I3</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">* The URL for a statistical table may change in case of the KOSIS revision.</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○Comment</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">TABLE : -The total figure at the national level includes unknown figures at the level of Si-Do."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           The total figure at the Si-Do level includes unknown figures at the level of Si, Gun and Gu."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           The total figure at the Si level includes unknown figures at the level of Gu."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           The total figure at the Gu level includes unknown figures at the level of Dong."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           The total figure at the Do level includes unknown figures at the level of Si and Gun."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           The total figure at the Si-Gun level includes unknown figures at the level of Dong, Eup and Myeon."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          -Excludes foreigners."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          -Excludes Korean diplomats and their families in abroad(about 1200 persons) in 1970."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          -The age interval for 5~9 in 1949 refers to the age interval of 0~9."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          -The age interval for 60~64 in 1949 refers to the age interval of 60 and more."</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         Item ] Sex ratio : Sex ratio means the number of male per one hundred female"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
